---
id: dashboard-insights
name: Account Insights
description: Savings goal progress and a helpful account insight.
category: Dashboards/Components
---
<style>
  .specux-insights { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .specux-insight-card {
    padding: 17px 17px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--theme-border, #e7ebf2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--theme-surface, #fff);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 7px rgb(28 45 80 / 3%);
  }
  .specux-insight-eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--theme-muted, #8490a3); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; }
  .specux-insight-title { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--theme-ink, #2c3950); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .specux-insight-copy { margin: 0; color: var(--theme-muted, #7c889b); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .specux-goal-amount { margin: 13px 0 7px; color: var(--theme-ink, #253149); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 750; }
  .specux-goal-amount span { color: var(--theme-muted, #8a95a7); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; }
  .specux-goal-track { height: 7px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--theme-surface-muted, #edf0f5); }
  .specux-goal-progress { width: 62%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--theme-primary, #5975df); }
  .specux-goal-caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 7px; color: var(--theme-muted, #8a95a7); font-size: 9px; }
  .specux-tip-mark { display: inline-grid; width: 24px; height: 24px; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 9px; border-radius: 7px; color: var(--theme-warning, #a26b1f); background: var(--theme-warning-surface, #fff5df); font-weight: 750; }
</style>
<aside class="specux-insights">
  <section class="specux-insight-card">
    <p class="specux-insight-eyebrow">YOUR GOAL</p>
    <h2 class="specux-insight-title">Summer travel fund</h2>
    <p class="specux-insight-copy">You're making steady progress toward your next trip.</p>
    <p class="specux-goal-amount">$6,250 <span>of $10,000</span></p>
    <div class="specux-goal-track"><div class="specux-goal-progress"></div></div>
    <div class="specux-goal-caption"><span>62% complete</span><span>Target: Jun 1</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="specux-insight-card">
    <span class="specux-tip-mark">i</span>
    <h2 class="specux-insight-title">A little more saved, every month</h2>
    <p class="specux-insight-copy">An automatic transfer of $150 each month could help you reach your goal 4 months sooner.</p>
  </section>
</aside>
